Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[(18:23)sign: Blue title: The victims have nothing in common. Could The Slasher have done it?!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Black: Slashings have happened one after the other in Tokyo prefecture's Toyojima ward. In the Southern Ikebukuro area of the ward, passers by are cut with a blade...
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One male (22) had his throat cut from behind while on his way home.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,None of the victims have anything in common, so the probability that The Slasher is behind these is high. [Read The Whole Article]]
